{"seq":9,"slug":"tourism-mgmt","title":"旅游管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"旅游管理-简介\">旅游管理 简介</h1><p>旅游管理研究的是如何把&quot;吸引人前来&quot;的资源和&quot;服务好到来之人&quot;的运营，组织成一个可持续创造价值的产业。它面对的是一个约束条件极其特殊的行业：产品不可储存（今晚没卖出的客房价值永久消失）、需求高度季节性（黄金周挤爆、平日空荡）、体验即时交付不可返工、满意度取决于全程最短板。正因如此，收益管理、容量管理、目的地品牌这些工具在旅游业被磨砺得最为锋利——本 hub 讲的就是这套&quot;在硬约束下做管理&quot;的方法体系。</p>\n<p>全 hub 共四章十二课时，按&quot;现象—资源—运营—价值&quot;层层递进：<strong>第一章 旅游学基础</strong> 建立概念地基（旅游的定义与六要素、旅游者决策行为、产业链结构）；<strong>第二章 资源与规划</strong> 讲产业源头（资源分类评价、景区规划与容量红线、可持续旅游）；<strong>第三章 酒店与运营</strong> 进入管理核心（酒店收益管理与 RevPAR、旅行社与 OTA 平台博弈、目的地品牌营销）；<strong>第四章 营销与经济</strong> 收束于价值实现（旅游营销 7P、乘数效应与经济影响、智慧旅游趋势）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与同级管理学-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与同级管理学 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>管理学 category 下各 hub 各管一段，旅游管理不重复它们的通用内容，而是展示通用理论在一个&quot;体验型服务业&quot;里的行业化变形：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相邻 hub</th>\n<th>它讲什么</th>\n<th>本 hub 的分工边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工商管理</td>\n<td>跨行业通用的管理职能：战略、组织、财务、运营</td>\n<td>本 hub 把这些职能放进&quot;产品不可储存、需求季节波动、服务即时交付&quot;的行业约束下重推一遍，得到的是行业特有工具（RevPAR、容量公式、DMO 治理），而非通用框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场营销</td>\n<td>STP、4P/7P、品牌等通用营销方法论</td>\n<td>本 hub 不再推导这些框架，只讲它们在&quot;无形产品 + 高信任门槛&quot;下的变形：口碑与种草、动态定价、目的地品牌。先学框架再来本 hub 看落地，顺序最顺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公共管理</td>\n<td>政府治理、公共政策、公共部门管理</td>\n<td>目的地管理的另一半主角是政府（文旅局即 DMO），涉及市场监管、限流政策、基础设施供给；想深挖&quot;政府如何治理一个产业&quot;，去公共管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字经济</td>\n<td>平台经济、数据要素、数字化的通用逻辑</td>\n<td>本 hub 第四章的智慧旅游是数字技术在一个垂直行业的应用切片（客流预测、AI 动态定价）；平台与算法的系统理论以数字经济为准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会计学</td>\n<td>复式记账、报表编制与分析</td>\n<td>本 hub 用到 RevPAR 等经营指标但止步于运营口径；指标背后的财务核算与报表逻辑归会计学</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>零基础通识读者</strong>（想看懂新闻里的旅游业，约 4 课时）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"tourism-fundamentals/tourism-concept-system\">旅游的概念与产业体系</a> — 建立&quot;六要素 + 产业链&quot;的基本地图</li>\n<li><a href=\"tourism-fundamentals/tourist-behavior\">旅游者行为与消费决策</a> — 理解人为什么出行、如何被&quot;种草&quot;</li>\n<li><a href=\"hospitality-management/destination-management\">目的地管理与品牌营销</a> — 看懂淄博、哈尔滨式的网红城市现象</li>\n<li><a href=\"tourism-marketing-economy/tourism-economics-impact\">旅游经济与影响</a> — 用乘数效应理解&quot;西湖免门票反而赚更多&quot;</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>课程学习者</strong>（旅游管理专业、专升本、考研）：按第 1→2→3→4 章顺序全部精读，章节间是严格的递进关系（不懂旅游者行为就读不了市场细分，不懂容量就读不懂限流政策）。重点吃透四组定量工具：AHP 资源评价（2-1）、环境容量公式（2-2）、RevPAR 与收益管理（3-1）、旅游乘数公式（4-2）——它们是考试与实务的高频落点。</p>\n<p><strong>行业从业者</strong>（酒店 / 旅行社 / 景区 / 文旅运营）：直接从第三章切入——<a href=\"hospitality-management/hotel-operations\">酒店运营与收益管理</a> → <a href=\"hospitality-management/travel-agency-ota\">旅行社与在线旅游平台</a>，对齐自己所处的分销位置与定价实践；再做<a href=\"tourism-resources-planning/scenic-area-planning\">景区规划与开发</a>补规划视角，最后用<a href=\"tourism-marketing-economy/smart-tourism-digital\">智慧旅游与数字化转型</a>看行业走向。第一、二章可在遇到概念盲点时回查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>高中地理</strong>：旅游资源成因、区位与交通分析——第二章资源评价直接建立在其上。</li>\n<li><strong>初等数学</strong>：百分比与加权平均即可。本 hub 全部定量工具（AHP 加权求和、容量公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{A}{a} \\times \\frac{T}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RevPAR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Occ</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>ADR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RevPAR} = \\text{Occ} \\times \\text{ADR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RevPAR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Occ</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ADR</span></span></span></span></span></span>、乘数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = \\frac{1}{1 - c(1-L)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3651em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>）都只用到四则运算。</li>\n<li><strong>基础经济学常识</strong>：供需与弹性概念（第四章收入弹性、价格弹性会用到）。未学过也能读，文中均给出定义与直觉解释。</li>\n<li><strong>无需行业经验</strong>：所有概念从零建立，案例均为公开知名案例（西湖免门票、淄博烧烤、九寨沟限流等）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>学完本 hub 后，若想在相邻领域继续深入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../business-administration/\">工商管理</a>：回到跨行业通用视角，看战略、组织与财务的一般框架，与本 hub 的行业化工具互为对照。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../marketing/\">市场营销</a>：系统学习本 hub 反复引用却未展开的 STP、7P 与品牌方法论。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../public-administration/\">公共管理</a>：深入目的地管理背后的政府侧逻辑——市场监管、公共政策与公共部门运作。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../digital-economy/\">数字经济</a>：追下去智慧旅游背后的平台经济与数据要素的通用理论。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-fundamentals","title":"旅游学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-concept-system","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游的概念与产业体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals/tourism-concept-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tourist-behavior","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游者行为与消费决策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals/tourist-behavior"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tourism-industry-structure","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游产业结构与参与者","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-fundamentals/tourism-industry-structure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"tourism-resources-planning","title":"Tourism Resources Planning","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-resources-evaluation","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游资源分类与评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/tourism-resources-evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scenic-area-planning","title":"大学旅游管理 — 景区规划与开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/scenic-area-planning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-ecotourism","title":"大学旅游管理 — 可持续旅游与生态旅游","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/sustainable-ecotourism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"hospitality-management","title":"Hospitality Management","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/hospitality-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hotel-operations","title":"大学旅游管理 — 酒店运营与收益管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/hospitality-management/hotel-operations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"travel-agency-ota","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅行社与在线旅游平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/hospitality-management/travel-agency-ota"},{"seq":3,"slug":"destination-management","title":"大学旅游管理 — 目的地管理与品牌营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/hospitality-management/destination-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"tourism-marketing-economy","title":"Tourism Marketing Economy","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-marketing","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游市场营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy/tourism-marketing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tourism-economics-impact","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游经济与影响","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy/tourism-economics-impact"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-tourism-digital","title":"大学旅游管理 — 智慧旅游与数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy/smart-tourism-digital"}]}]}